IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `clatas-dates`
IMPORT `clatas-common`
IMPORT `clatas-abuse`

-- Civil Liability Act 2002 (Tas) -- baseline-2026-11: cases for clatas-abuse.l4 (Part 10C and s 7AA).
-- Edges: age 17 and 18; abuse on 30 April and 1 May 2020; the last day of the 60 days after service and the day after;
-- the 28th and 29th day after the application; a judgment just under, at and over the value of the trust property.
-- Expected values are worked by hand from the deposited text. The facts are illustrative.
-- BASELINE. Not for public use as advice.

§ `Cases -- child abuse: liability of organisations`

§§ `Short names`

`d` MEANS `the calendar date`
`sexual` MEANS `sexual abuse`
`physical` MEANS `physical abuse`
`psych from` MEANS `psychological abuse arising from sexual or physical abuse`
`psych alone` MEANS `psychological abuse alone, or neglect, or something else`

§§ `What child abuse is`

`abuse` MEANS `Is it child abuse`
#ASSERT abuse `sexual` 15 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT abuse `physical` 17 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT abuse `sexual` 18 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT abuse `psych from` 12 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT abuse `psych alone` 12 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Lawful when it happened.
#ASSERT abuse `physical` 10 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 49H -- the presumption of breach`

`cared` MEANS `it exercised, or purported to exercise, care, supervision or authority over me`
`delegated` MEANS `it delegated care, supervision or authority over me to another organisation`
`not responsible` MEANS `none of these`
`staff` MEANS `office holder, officer, employee, owner, volunteer or contractor`
`priest` MEANS `religious leader or personnel of a religious organisation`
`funder` MEANS `linked only because it funds or regulates the abuser's organisation`

`presumed` MEANS `the organisation is presumed to have breached its duty of care (s 49H(3))`
`rebutted` MEANS `no presumption: the organisation has established it took reasonable precautions (s 49H(3))`
`not established` MEANS `no presumption: the facts s 49H(3) needs are not established`
`49H off` MEANS `s 49H does not apply`

-- Arguments: day; what; age; lawful; the State itself; place in my care; abuser's link; authority etc through the link;
-- able through it; reasonable precautions established.
`49H` MEANS `Is the organisation presumed in breach`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 5 2020) `sexual` 14 FALSE FALSE `cared` `staff` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `presumed`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 30 4 2020) `sexual` 14 FALSE FALSE `cared` `staff` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `49H off`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 14 FALSE FALSE `cared` `staff` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `rebutted`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `physical` 9 FALSE FALSE `delegated` `priest` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `presumed`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 14 FALSE TRUE `cared` `staff` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `49H off`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 14 FALSE FALSE `not responsible` `staff` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `49H off`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 14 FALSE FALSE `cared` `funder` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not established`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 14 FALSE FALSE `cared` `staff` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not established`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 14 FALSE FALSE `cared` `staff` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not established`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 18 FALSE FALSE `cared` `staff` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not established`
#ASSERT `49H` (d 1 6 2022) `psych alone` 12 FALSE FALSE `cared` `staff` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not established`

§§ `ss 49I, 49J -- vicarious liability`

-- Arguments: day; what; age; lawful; the State itself; employee; aims; role gave position; independent business;
-- position through the role; able through it.
`49J` MEANS `Is the organisation vicariously liable`
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 5 2020) `sexual` 13 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `49J` (d 30 4 2020) `sexual` 13 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Akin to an employee (s 49I(2)).
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 6 2022) `physical` 13 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A recognisably independent business (s 49I(3)).
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 6 2022) `physical` 13 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 6 2022) `physical` 13 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 13 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 13 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 13 FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `49J` (d 1 6 2022) `sexual` 18 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `ss 49M, 49N -- suing an unincorporated organisation`

`sue` MEANS `Can I sue the unincorporated organisation`
#ASSERT sue `sexual` 12 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `I can sue the unincorporated organisation in its own name, or a name reasonably sufficient to identify it (s 49M(1))`
#ASSERT sue `sexual` 12 FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `Division 4 is not needed: the organisation is incorporated`
#ASSERT sue `physical` 12 FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the State is taken to be the proper defendant for the Government department (s 49N(3))`
#ASSERT sue `psych alone` 12 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Division 4 does not apply: my claim is not for child abuse`

§§ `s 49P -- appointing the trustees of an associated trust`

-- Served on 1 March 2026: the 60 days end on 30 April 2026.
`from when` MEANS `From what day can I apply for the trustees to be appointed`
#ASSERT `from when` (d 1 3 2026) EQUALS d 1 5 2026
#ASSERT `from when` (d 15 1 2026) EQUALS d 17 3 2026

`controls income` MEANS `it controls the application of the trust's income or the distribution of its property`
`appoints trustees` MEANS `it can appoint or remove the trustees`
`member used` MEANS `a member or management member has such a power under the trust deed, and the trust was established or used for the organisation`
`member unused` MEANS `a member or management member has such a power under the trust deed, but the trust was not established or used for the organisation`
`moved away` MEANS `the trust was formerly associated, and the court considers it ceased to be so to avoid liability and that not appointing its trustees would be unjust`
`unlinked` MEANS `no link to the trust`

`can appoint` MEANS `the court can appoint the trustees as the proper defendant on my application (s 49P(2))`
`not yet` MEANS `not yet: the 60 days after service have not ended (s 49P(1)(a))`
`has one` MEANS `no: a suitable proper defendant has been appointed (s 49P(1))`
`not associated` MEANS `no: the trust is not an associated trust of the organisation (s 49P(2), (3))`
`not suitable` MEANS `no: the trustees are not a suitable proper defendant (ss 49O, 49P(2))`

-- Arguments: served; day asked; suitable proper defendant in place; link; can be sued in Tasmania; enough assets.
`appoint` MEANS `Can the court appoint the trustees as proper defendant`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 30 4 2026) FALSE `controls income` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `not yet`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `controls income` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `can appoint`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) TRUE `controls income` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `has one`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `appoints trustees` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `can appoint`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `member used` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `can appoint`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `member unused` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `not associated`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `moved away` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `can appoint`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `unlinked` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `not associated`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `controls income` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not suitable`
#ASSERT appoint (d 1 3 2026) (d 1 5 2026) FALSE `controls income` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not suitable`

§§ `s 49P(4) -- the organisation must identify its trusts within 28 days`

`identify by` MEANS `By what day must the organisation identify its trusts`
#ASSERT `identify by` (d 1 5 2026) EQUALS d 29 5 2026
#ASSERT `identify by` (d 10 12 2026) EQUALS d 7 1 2027

`kept` MEANS `the duty is kept, or can still be kept (s 49P(4))`
`late` MEANS `late: the organisation did not identify its associated trusts within 28 days after my application (s 49P(4))`

-- Arguments: applied; has identified; the day it did; the day asked about.
`trusts late` MEANS `Is the organisation late identifying its trusts`
#ASSERT `trusts late` (d 1 5 2026) TRUE (d 29 5 2026) (d 1 7 2026) EQUALS `kept`
#ASSERT `trusts late` (d 1 5 2026) TRUE (d 10 5 2026) (d 1 7 2026) EQUALS `kept`
#ASSERT `trusts late` (d 1 5 2026) TRUE (d 30 5 2026) (d 1 7 2026) EQUALS `late`
#ASSERT `trusts late` (d 1 5 2026) FALSE (d 1 1 2000) (d 15 5 2026) EQUALS `kept`
#ASSERT `trusts late` (d 1 5 2026) FALSE (d 1 1 2000) (d 29 5 2026) EQUALS `kept`
#ASSERT `trusts late` (d 1 5 2026) FALSE (d 1 1 2000) (d 30 5 2026) EQUALS `late`

§§ `s 49R -- recovering from the trustees`

`from trustees` MEANS `How much can I recover from the trustees`
#ASSERT `from trustees` 300000 200000 EQUALS 200000
#ASSERT `from trustees` 200000 200000 EQUALS 200000
#ASSERT `from trustees` 199999 200000 EQUALS 199999

§§ `s 7AA -- an organisation's apology`

`org apology` MEANS `Can the organisation's apology be used as evidence of fault`
#ASSERT `org apology` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `org apology` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `org apology` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `org apology` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
